    <bpmn:process id="W_W5028" name="W5028. Shareholder Services, Investor Self-Service Portal &amp; Inquiry Handling" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Shareholder service request; portal access; inquiry; lifecycle event (death/inheritance/address change)
Frequency: Continuous
Volume: ~100–300 shareholder service requests per year
Owner: VP Investor Relations / Company Secretary (VS-36) / Transfer Agent
Participants: Transfer Agent, Legal (VS-100), Compliance (VS-22), Finance (VS-17), IT (VS-27)
Source: workflow W5028 — Shareholder Services, Investor Self-Service Portal &amp; Inquiry Handling</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5028_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5028_Lane1" name="Company Secretary">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5028_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5028_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5028_Lane2" name="IT">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5028_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5028_Lane3" name="VP IR">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5028_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5028_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5028_Start5" name="Shareholder service request; portal access; inquiry; lifecycle event…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5028_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5028_Task6" name="Operate shareholder services: holdings/certificate/inquiry handling…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Operate shareholder services: holdings/certificate/inquiry handling, address/bank-detail updates, lifecycle events (inheritance/transfer W5026, name change), document issuance, and the fair-disclosure-compliant response standard (W5017) — distinct from analyst inquiry handling (W5015)
Responsible (R): Company Secretary / Transfer Agent / VP IR
Accountable (A): Company Secretary
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5028_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5028_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5028_Task7" name="Run the investor self-service portal: secure shareholder access to holdings…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Run the investor self-service portal: secure shareholder access to holdings, dividend history (W5027), tax certificates (links VS-79), ASHM/proxy/e-voting (W5020), and forms — with RA 10173 privacy, identity verification, and records retention (VS-88)
Responsible (R): IT / VP IR / Transfer Agent
Accountable (A): VP IR / IT
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5028_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5028_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5028_Task8" name="Manage exceptions &amp; assurance: service-SLA monitoring, complaint escalation…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Manage exceptions &amp; assurance: service-SLA monitoring, complaint escalation, privacy/fraud controls, and audit of shareholder-services/portal operations (VS-21)
Responsible (R): VP IR / Compliance / Audit
Accountable (A): VP IR
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5028_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5028_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5028_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
