        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-751 (ensure controlled execution — Shareholder Services, Equity Records, Dividend &amp; IR Analytics (PA-173.3).) | - CTL-751: identity-verified access; privacy-compliant (VS-91); public-info-only (W5017); SLA-monitored; audited (VS-21)
Owner: VP Investor Relations / Company Secretary (VS-36) / Transfer Agent</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
