      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Analytics cycle; earnings; event/roadshow (W5012); rating/coverage change; activist signal
Frequency: Periodic (monthly/quarterly) + event-driven
Volume: ~12 monthly analytics cycles × audiences/signals
Owner: VP Investor Relations / Analytics (VS-28)
Participants: Analytics (VS-28), Strategy (VS-33), CFO/CEO, Treasury (VS-18), Marketing/Comms (VS-14)
