      <bpmn:userTask id="W5029_Task4" name="Measure investor perception &amp; sentiment: post-meeting/event feedback…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Measure investor perception &amp; sentiment: post-meeting/event feedback (W5012/W5015), analyst-report tone/sentiment, consensus vs guidance (W5013), media/social sentiment (links VS-14), and shareholder-survey insight
Responsible (R): VP IR / Analytics / IR Analyst
Accountable (A): VP IR
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5029_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5029_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5029_Task5" name="Analyze ownership &amp; flow: ownership concentration/shift (W5010), retail vs…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Analyze ownership &amp; flow: ownership concentration/shift (W5010), retail vs institutional, turnover/flow, threshold crossings &amp; activist signals (W5032), and rating/coverage trajectory (W5013)
Responsible (R): VP IR / Analytics
Accountable (A): VP IR
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5029_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5029_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5029_Task6" name="Synthesize insight to management: integrate perception/sentiment/ownership…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Synthesize insight to management: integrate perception/sentiment/ownership insight into the board/management feedback (W5024), the IR plan (W5009), and the equity-story/narrative refresh (W5009)
Responsible (R): VP IR / Strategy
Accountable (A): VP IR / CFO
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5029_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
