    <bpmn:process id="W_W5031" name="W5031. IR Function Budget, Spend &amp; Performance / ROI Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual budget; quarterly review; IR-plan refresh (W5009); major event/transaction
Frequency: Annual + quarterly
Volume: ~1 IR function budget × cycles
Owner: VP Investor Relations / Finance (VS-34/VS-17)
Participants: Finance (VS-34/VS-17), Procurement (VS-34), Strategy (VS-33), Compliance (VS-22)
Source: workflow W5031 — IR Function Budget, Spend &amp; Performance / ROI Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5031_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5031_Lane1" name="VP IR">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5031_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5031_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5031_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5031_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5031_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5031_Start3" name="Annual budget; quarterly review; IR-plan refresh (W5009); major event/transaction">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5031_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5031_Task4" name="Plan the IR budget: the IR/people cost, advisor/banker/IR-vendor/consulting…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Plan the IR budget: the IR/people cost, advisor/banker/IR-vendor/consulting spend, event/roadshow cost (W5012), platform/portal cost (W5014/W5028), disclosure/filing fees (W5018/W5021), and analytics (W5029) — aligned to the IR plan (W5009)
Responsible (R): VP IR / Finance / Procurement
Accountable (A): VP IR / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5031_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5031_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5031_Task5" name="Manage spend &amp; vendors: IR-vendor/transfer-agent/advisor contracting &amp;…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Manage spend &amp; vendors: IR-vendor/transfer-agent/advisor contracting &amp; performance (links VS-34 procurement, VS-161 TPRM for vendor risk), spend tracking vs budget, and procurement-compliance (VS-34)
Responsible (R): VP IR / Finance / Procurement
Accountable (A): VP IR
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5031_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5031_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5031_Task6" name="Measure performance &amp; ROI: IR KPIs (coverage, sentiment W5029, valuation gap…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Measure performance &amp; ROI: IR KPIs (coverage, sentiment W5029, valuation gap W5030, cost-of-capital impact), function effectiveness, and ROI of IR spend/events; feed to management (W5024) and the plan (W5009)
Responsible (R): VP IR / Finance / Analytics
Accountable (A): VP IR / CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5031_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5031_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5031_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5031_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-751 (ensure controlled execution — Shareholder Services, Equity Records, Dividend &amp; IR Analytics (PA-173.3).) | - CTL-751: budget planned &amp; tracked; vendors TPRM-screened (VS-161); performance/ROI measured (W5029/W5030)
