    <bpmn:process id="W_W5032" name="W5032. Crisis, Activist-Investor &amp; Transaction IR Response Coordination" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Activist accumulation/nomination; crisis/event (W5019); unsolicited approach; M&amp;A/transaction (VS-130); rating downgrade
Frequency: Event-driven
Volume: Rare: ~0–2 activist/crisis/transaction incidents per year
Owner: VP Investor Relations / VP Legal &amp; Compliance (VS-100) / CFO / Strategy (VS-33)
Participants: Legal (VS-100), Strategy (VS-33), M&amp;A (VS-130), Crisis Comms (VS-14), Corporate Security (VS-159), Treasury (VS-18), Governance (VS-36), External advisors
Source: workflow W5032 — Crisis, Activist-Investor &amp; Transaction IR Response Coordination</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5032_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5032_Lane1" name="VP IR">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5032_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
